idth:100%;flex:0 0 auto;height:auto;align-self:flex-start;background-color:;margin:3px 0px 0px -20px;box-sizing:border-box;\"><section style=\"margin:0px 0%;justify-content:center;transform:translate3d(4px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform:translate3d(4px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform:translate3d(4px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform:translate3d(4px, 0px, 0px);position:static;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"font-size:18px;color:#3e3e3e;padding:0px 22px;line-height:2;box-sizing:border-box;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">古河云应急保供业务管理平台</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"padding:0px 4px;line-height:1.7;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\" /></p><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">古河云科技自研的“开河”数字化云支撑平台，以中台化思想、云架构理念为核心，依托物联网、数字孪生、云计算、AI等前沿科技技术，围绕集成接入、技术支撑、业务应用、产品矩阵、解决方案等五大维度进行产品技术整合，构建起一套能够融合各类三方软硬件系统并且适用于全业务应用场景的数字化底层支撑平台。</p><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\" /></p><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">基于“开河”数字化云支撑平台打造的<span style=\"color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\">应急保供业务管理平台</span>通过建立一个统一协调指挥、结构完整、资源共享、保障有力的应急保供调度体系，打通事前布局、事发应对、事中处置和善后管理业务链条，实现事前工作数字化、构建信息数据库；事后快速调阅和运用数字化应急救援策略，提升应急处置效率，全方位有效应对疫情封控突发事件，全面保障市场资源的稳定供给。</p><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\" /></p></section><section style=\"position:static;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;margin:12px 0% 10px;text-align:center;justify-content:center;position:static;box-sizing:border-box;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block